{"acceptance_criteria": "", "actor": "", "agent_state": "", "await_id": "", "await_type": "", "close_reason": "Closed", "closed_at": "2026-02-04 20:37:04", "closed_by_session": "", "compaction_level": 0, "content_hash": "6b05709303fa1ba92a4b01e75f1176894ecc73da56c113aff94faedd796f3107", "created_at": "2026-02-01 20:59:04", "created_by": "Will Dower", "crystallizes": 0, "description": "The `Requirement_Result.status` field is currently optional/nullable but should be required. Every test execution produces a status (passed/failed/error/notApplicable/notReviewed).\n\n## Rationale\n- Every test result has a status outcome\n- Status is fundamental to understanding test results\n- Making it optional creates ambiguity\n- All converters already provide status\n\n## Changes Required\n\n### Schema Changes (TDD Approach)\n\n1. **Update tests first**\n   - Update test fixtures to always include status\n   - Add tests that reject results without status\n   - Verify all existing tests pass\n\n2. **Update schema**\n   - result.schema.json: Change status from `anyOf: [Result_Status, null]` to just `$ref: Result_Status`\n   - Add `status` to required fields in Requirement_Result\n   - Regenerate types\n\n3. **Update helpers**\n   - Ensure createResult helper always includes status\n   - Add validation that status is provided\n\n4. **Update converters**\n   - Verify all converters provide status\n   - sarif-to-hdf: Always set status based on result\n   - nessus-to-hdf: Always set status based on compliance result\n   - Add default status handling for edge cases\n\n### Files to Update\n- `hdf-schema/src/schemas/primitives/result.schema.json`\n- `hdf-schema/src/helpers.js`\n- `hdf-schema/src/helpers.d.ts`\n- `hdf-schema/test/hdf-results.test.ts`\n- All converter files\n- All converter test files\n\n### Validation\n- All existing converters already provide status\n- Check that no converter has code paths that omit status\n- Verify test coverage for status handling\n\n## Breaking Change\nThis is a breaking change but should have minimal impact as all current converters already provide status.\n\n## Priority\nMedium - Improves schema strictness and clarity", "design": "", "ephemeral": 0, "event_kind": "", "hook_bead": "", "id": "hdf-libs-40e", "is_template": 0, "issue_type": "task", "metadata": "{}", "mol_type": "", "notes": "", "owner": "will@dower.dev", "payload": "", "pinned": 0, "priority": 2, "rig": "", "role_bead": "", "role_type": "", "sender": "", "source_repo": "", "source_system": "", "spec_id": "", "status": "closed", "target": "", "timeout_ns": 0, "title": "Make Requirement_Result.status required field", "updated_at": "2026-02-22 19:22:47", "waiters": "", "wisp_type": "", "work_type": ""}
