{"acceptance_criteria": "", "actor": "", "agent_state": "", "await_id": "", "await_type": "", "close_reason": "Implemented as dataSource field on HdfResults (schema + all converters) in commits 7c2f694 and 1a4a878.", "closed_at": "2026-02-20 21:28:44", "closed_by_session": "", "compaction_level": 0, "content_hash": "f6cc21185cd613cb6405fd881019448e831bb8c3b221c634dde674b8201b8630", "created_at": "2026-02-20 16:47:03", "created_by": "Will", "crystallizes": 0, "description": "The current Generator field conflates two distinct concepts: (1) the source tool that produced the original scan data (e.g. Nessus, gosec, SonarQube) and (2) the software that actually created the HDF file (e.g. hdf-converters, hdf-cli). Both need to be representable independently so consumers can determine provenance without inspecting converter internals.\n\nProposed change: split Generator into two fields or sub-fields:\n- source (or dataSource): name/version of the original scanning tool\n- converter (or creator): name/version of the HDF-producing tool\n\nThis is a schema-level change (hdf-schema) with downstream impact on:\n- hdf-schema: TypeScript type definitions and JSON schema\n- hdf-schema Go package: struct definitions\n- hdf-validators: update validation rules for new/renamed fields\n- hdf-converters (all converters, both Go and TypeScript): update Generator construction\n- hdf-cli: update CLI version injection\n- hdf-parsers: update any field references\n- Possibly hdf-to-csv, hdf-to-xml output-side converters\n\nDesign questions to resolve before implementation:\n- New top-level fields vs nested under existing Generator?\n- Backwards compatibility: is the old Generator field deprecated or removed?\n- Field names: source/converter, dataSource/creator, or something else?\n- Version field: does each sub-field carry its own version, or shared?\n- How should converters that have no meaningful 'source version' (e.g. static file import) populate the source field?", "design": "", "ephemeral": 0, "event_kind": "", "hook_bead": "", "id": "hdf-libs-73r", "is_template": 0, "issue_type": "task", "metadata": "{}", "mol_type": "", "notes": "", "owner": "will@dower.dev", "payload": "", "pinned": 0, "priority": 2, "rig": "", "role_bead": "", "role_type": "", "sender": "", "source_repo": "", "source_system": "", "spec_id": "", "status": "closed", "target": "", "timeout_ns": 0, "title": "HDF schema: separate data-source from tool-creator in Generator", "updated_at": "2026-02-22 19:22:50", "waiters": "", "wisp_type": "", "work_type": ""}
